rem *** S&T Changes ***
rem engine sounds
rem towed guns put down/lift up sounds & remove 2nd SupplyDepot.ssc
rem Nebelwerfer + Panzerwerfer firing sound
rem Flak 18 Carriage.ssc relinked to HeavyAACarriage.ssc

rem ============================================================================
